        <item>
            <title>3.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 14:41:40 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>159</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The launcher can now start a new session on another Mac. Pick the Mac in the machine chip, then send your first prompt (text and images) with the model, effort and permission mode you choose. Resuming a closed session there still works from the same menu.

### Bug Fixes
- While an update waited for a running session to finish before restarting Canopy's background service, the phone app and other Macs could not connect to this Mac. They now connect normally during that wait.
]]></description>
