        <item>
            <title>3.1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 13:20:21 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>158</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- A file link tapped in a live session on Canopy Mobile can now be sent to the phone and opened there, instead of opening on this Mac. Needs Canopy Mobile 3.2.0; older phones keep the previous behaviour.

### Bug Fixes
- File links in a session running in a git worktree now open when they point into the main checkout it came from (for example a gitignored `build/` folder), on the Mac and from the phone.
- The sidebar's usage bars kept updating only until launch: they froze, showed "soon" past their reset, and per-model rows disappeared. They now follow live usage again.
]]></description>
